{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"沃伦·巴菲特·争议与评价","stage":"DONE","category":"warren-buffett","categoryLabel":"沃伦·巴菲特","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":null,"chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-controversies","title":"投资争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"missing-the-tech-wave","title":"错过科技浪潮","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies/missing-the-tech-wave","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"derivatives-and-criticism","title":"衍生品与批评","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies/derivatives-and-criticism","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 投资争议\n\n巴菲特虽享盛誉，其投资生涯也并非全无争议。本章直面其中两个常被讨论的话题。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"错过科技浪潮\"——他长期回避科技股的争议，及其坚守能力圈的取舍。第二篇文档讲述\"衍生品与批评\",考察他对衍生品的态度、个别投资的质疑与方法适应性之争。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"succession-and-scale","title":"接班与规模","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/succession-and-scale","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-succession-question","title":"接班难题","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/succession-and-scale/the-succession-question","wordCount":1784,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-size-problem","title":"规模的难题","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/succession-and-scale/the-size-problem","wordCount":1721,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 接班与规模\n\n巴菲特晚年事业面临两大现实挑战。本章考察这两道难题。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"接班难题\"——伯克希尔高度依赖巴菲特个人天才所带来的传承挑战。第二篇文档讲述\"规模的难题\",剖析庞大资金规模如何反而成为持续超额回报的障碍。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元评价","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"admirers-and-critics","title":"崇拜者与批评者","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/admirers-and-critics","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 多元评价\n\n对巴菲特的评价虽总体正面，仍有多元的声音。本章呈现这些声音并给出历史定位。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"崇拜者与批评者\"——高度推崇与清醒审视两种声音的并存与价值。第二篇文档讲述\"历史地位的评判\",在历史尺度上审视他作为最伟大投资家与道德典范的崇高地位。\n"}]}